{"t":"Nordic Tibia Ferries","s":"nordic-tibia-ferries-ddbf0","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Anderson_d0cc9b.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Nordic Tibia Ferries</strong> are traveling among the islands:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Folda\">Folda</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Senja\">Senja</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vega\">Vega</a></li></ul>\n<p>The prices are:\n</p>\n<ul><li>10 gp from an island to other island.</li>\n<li>20 gp from <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20%28Continent%29\">mainland</a> to an island.</li>\n<li>Free from an island to <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20%28Continent%29\">mainland</a></li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Nordic Tibia Ferries</strong> (4 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Anderson\">Anderson</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Anderson\"><img alt=\"Anderson\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Anderson_d0cc9b.gif\" width=\"63\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Ferryman</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">Western <a href=\"#/wiki/Senja\">Senja</a>, on his raft</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlson\">Carlson</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\">